Ordinance on Telecommunications Services (OTS)
SR 784.101.1 — Ordinance of 9 March 2007 on Telecommunications Services (OTS).
|

:NOTE [links:https://fedlex.data.admin.ch/eli/cc/2007/166]
English is not an official language of the Swiss Confederation. This translation is provided for information purposes only and has no legal force.
This English text is the consolidation of 1 March 2026. The binding German, French and Italian texts have since been consolidated to 1 July 2026, so this translation is behind current law.

